            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The background helper could not be enabled, so the switch was restored. Review Login Items in System Settings, then try again. Technical details: %@"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "无法启用后台守护任务，开关已恢复。请检查「系统设置」中的登录项后重试。技术详情：%@"
          }
        }
