        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "提示：未打开下方「启用 AI 助手」时，主界面右键不会出现「问 AI」菜单项。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "settings.ai.howto.step1": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "1. Turn on \"AI Assistant\" below and fill in the endpoint / model / API Key."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "1. 打开下方的「启用 AI 助手」总开关，并填好端点 / 模型 / API Key。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "settings.ai.howto.step2": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "2. Back to the main window, right-click any scan result row (recommended cleanups, large files, custom paths, tree browser) and choose ✨ \"Ask AI\"."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "2. 回到主界面，在任意扫描结果行（推荐清理 / 大文件 / 自定义路径 / 树视图）上右键，选择 ✨「问 AI」即可询问该路径是否可以删除。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "settings.ai.howto.step3": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "3. The result sheet only shows advice; nothing is auto-selected for deletion. The local 3-tier gate (safe / confirm / forbid) stays the final authority."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "3. 结果面板只展示建议，不会自动勾选删除。最终是否删除仍由本地三档闸（安全 / 确认 / 禁止）说了算。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "settings.ai.howto.title": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
