            "value": "Partial scan: at least %1$@ is known on disk; the known file count is at least %2$@. Expand this row to locate locations that were not fully checked."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "扫描不完整：当前至少已统计 %1$@ 磁盘占用，已知文件数至少为 %2$@。展开此行可定位未完整检查的位置。"
